              "placeholder": "",
              "required": true,
              "reveal": {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For each telemetry reading, suppose you need the first later reading that exceeds it. Keep indices whose answer is still unknown; when a larger reading arrives, it resolves every smaller reading exposed at the stack top.",
